Package: python3-lxb-toolkit
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Piotr Lewandowski <piotr.petexy@gmail.com>
Section: python
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, lxb-toolkit (= @VERSION@-1)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/petexy/lxb-toolkit
Description: the LineXinBar design language, for Python
 The same design language through the same native core as the Rust and C APIs:
 colour roles, theme choices, glass, motion, sizes, type, the neutral marks and
 their material, and sound semantics.
 .
 The module is ctypes over the C ABI, so there is no build step, no compiler
 needed to install it, and no wheel per Python version.
